      <article data-paper-cat="ai-games" data-paper-tags="paper 16 brasas videojuegos unity c# flutter canvas roblox luau rig malla 2d qa">
        <span class="lab-card-label">Paper 16 · Game Engineering Report v1.0 · Nov 2026</span>
